RUN TESTS
=========

	python3 run_tests.py


PROCEDURE TO ADD A NEW TEST 
===========================

1. Generate reference (if necessary) output files in (amitex)/resultats/new_test/reference 
2. create file 'new_test.py', in there make a function make_input that returns a amitex.input.Input instance.
3. Add new_test to TESTS in testlist.py

Files to look at and possibly add defs into:
- mate.py: material definitions (like cas_tests/mate/mat_*)
- algo.py: material definitions (like cas_tests/algorithmes/algo_*)
- char.py: material definitions (like cas_tests/chargements/char_*)
